          "viz": "<svg viewBox='0 0 660 130' role='img' aria-label='资料整理：两次检测可直接反演腐蚀速率' style='width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:12px 0;border:1px solid #DDD8CB;border-radius:10px;background:#fff' font-family=\"system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\"><rect x='0' y='0' width='660' height='130' fill='#FBFaf6'/><text x='12' y='20' font-size='9' fill='#4d565b'>两次检测的差值就是真实速率：比区块经验值可靠得多，能大幅收窄置信区间</text><line x1='60' y1='92' x2='400' y2='92' stroke='#242b2e' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='60' y1='92' x2='60' y2='28' stroke='#242b2e' stroke-width='1'/><text x='180' y='108' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>服役年限 →</text><text x='46' y='38' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>壁厚</text><polyline points='70,44 130,50 190,56 250,62 310,68 370,74' fill='none' stroke='#41699b' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='130' cy='50' r='4' fill='#41699b'/><text x='140' y='46' font-size='8.5' fill='#41699b'>第 3 年检测 9.4 mm</text><circle cx='310' cy='68' r='4' fill='#c9613f'/><text x='320' y='64' font-size='8.5' fill='#c9613f'>第 9 年检测 7.6 mm</text><text x='200' y='88' font-size='9' fill='#2f7d6b'>反演速率 = (9.4 − 7.6) / 6 = 0.30 mm/年</text><rect x='430' y='36' width='218' height='58' rx='4' fill='#efece1' stroke='#e2ded0'/><text x='442' y='54' font-size='8.5' fill='#4d565b'>单次检测：只能给当前壁厚</text><text x='442' y='70' font-size='8.5' fill='#c9613f'>速率靠区块值：±22% 区间</text><text x='442' y='90' font-size='8.5' fill='#2f7d6b'>两次检测：速率实测 ±8%</text><text x='12' y='124' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>检测覆盖率决定置信度：这是结论能不能用于作业决策的前提</text></svg><div class='viz-cap'>图：资料整理：两次检测可直接反演腐蚀速率</div>"
